{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:52 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n\n<p>油麻地彌敦道有人墮樓。今日（23日）早上8時47分，警方接獲報案，指一名女子由高處墮下，倒臥在彌敦道333號一商廈的平台。救援人員趕至，發現年約30歲至40歲的女事主昏迷不醒，於是將她送往廣華醫院搶救。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，警方經初步調查，相信女子由彌敦道329至331號鄰廈的天台墮下，跌至涉事商廈的平台。據保安員稱從未見過涉事女子，警員正調查女子的身份及事件原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"女子飛墮商廈平台，警員登樓調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c6440d1f50b108f52f6fd79492b49027/2026-09/1_1_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5bc31cda5ea58802af6199ba94aa888c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_19_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子飛墮彌敦道333號的商廈平台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2c4b5599a85cd498b5aa6fa196a3aa52/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_18_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/458b2c8ea997677ed547cc386e9e6963/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/56caa140c7a0720ef883b09cd593fe7a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方初步調查後，相信女子由鄰廈天台墮樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f9ef77d701dc113c1dc24f5b0f04c582/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在鄰廈調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d024f10e3c6e77a73b2df234f696fe1f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_17_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0551fdecbd021dcbf3f2902a6e06eacf/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/cb22f2ae9335ea0d16092221aa4e105b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_09_33_16.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T06:18:52.451624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}